msgstr "Comment=Spiekerreferenz gellt nich."

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/developerrc:2
msgid "Comment=This signal is unknown."
msgstr "Comment=Dat Signaal is nich bekannt."

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:1
msgid "Name=End user"
msgstr "Name=Ennbruker"

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:1
msgid ""
"Name=The application %progname (%appname) crashed and caused the signal "
"%signum (%signame)."
msgstr ""
"Name=Dat Programm %progname (%appname) is afstört un hett dat Signaal "
"%signum (%signame) geven."

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:1
msgid ""
"Name=You might want to send a bug report for this application. Check if it "
"is listed on http://bugs.kde.org, otherwise mail the author. Please include "
"as much information as possible, maybe the original documents. If you have a "
"way to reproduce the error, include this also."
msgstr ""
"Name=Villicht wullt Du en Fehlerbericht för dit Programm sennen. Kiek na, "
"wat dat op http://bugs.kde.org list is, wenn nich, schick den Autor en "
"Nettbreef. Bitte so veel Informatschonen as mööglich tofögen, villicht ok "
"de Orginaal-Dokmenten. Wenn Du den Fehler toverlässig wedderhalen kannst, "
"bitte ok angeven, woans dat geiht."

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:2
msgid "Comment=Settings preferred for end users"
msgstr "Comment=Vörtrocken Instellen för normale Brukers"

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:2
msgid ""
"Comment=An application mostly receives the SIGILL signal due to a bug in the "
"application. The application was asked to save its documents."
msgstr ""
"Comment=En Programm kriggt dat SIGILL-Signaal tomehrst wiel dor Fehler "
"binnen is. Dat Programm wöör dor üm beedt, de Dokmenten to sekern."

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:2
msgid ""
"Comment=An application terminates with a SIGABRT signal when it detects an "
"internal inconsistency caused by a bug in the program."
msgstr ""
"Comment=En Programm beendt sik mit de SIGABRT-Signaal, wenn dat binnen sik "
"sülven wat findt, wat nich tosamenpasst. De Grund warrt tomehrst en Fehler "
"wesen."

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:2
msgid ""
"Comment=An application mostly receives the SIGFPE signal due to a bug in the "
"application. The application was asked to save its documents."
msgstr ""
"Comment=En Programm kriggt dat SIGFPE-Signaal tomehrst, wenn dat'n Fehler "
"dor binnen gifft. Dat Programm wöör beedt, sien Dokmenten to sekern."

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:2
msgid ""
"Comment=An application mostly receives the SIGSEGV signal due to a bug in "
"the application. The application was asked to save its documents."
msgstr ""
"Comment=En Programm kriggt dat SIGSEGV-Signaal tomehrst, wenn dat'n Fehler "
"dor binnen gifft. Dat Programm wöör beedt, sien Dokmenten to sekern."

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:2
msgid "Comment=Sorry, I do not know this signal."
msgstr "Comment=Deit mi leed, dat Signaal kenn ik nich."

